				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-d99b3b7 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget-mobile__width-inherit elementor-invisible elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="d99b3b7" data-element_type="widget" data-settings="{" _animation":"fadeinup"}"="" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<p>Lovely Garden Cafe Under the Frangipani Trees; where friends meet, laughs are shared, and memories are made. <br>Buzzing with good vibes, aroma of delicious food and fantastic cocktails.</p>								</div>
