		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-5a63afa e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="5a63afa" data-element_type="container">
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-d2b96bc e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child" data-id="d2b96bc" data-element_type="container">
					<div class="e-con-inner">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-0c48f07 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget-mobile__width-inherit elementor-invisible elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="0c48f07" data-element_type="widget" data-settings="{" _animation":"fadeinup"}"="" data-widget_type="heading.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
					<h2 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Chill vibes and everything nice!</h2>				</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-268db05 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget-mobile__width-inherit elementor-invisible elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="268db05" data-element_type="widget" data-settings="{" _animation":"fadeinright"}"="" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<p>At TAP, it’s all about you having a great time. We’re nestled between Haridwar &amp; Roorkee city, offering a perfect mix of a chill vibe and a lively atmosphere. Whether you’re a cocktail connoisseur or a foodie at heart, we’ve got something special for you!</p>								</div>
				</div>
					</div>
				</div>
				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-aeb3134 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child" data-id="aeb3134" data-element_type="container">
					<div class="e-con-inner">
